Enable All Gradual rollout of features for Windows 11 24H2

Microsoft uses Controlled Feature Rollout (CFR) technology to telemetry control most features. Some features may not be available immediately. Or as part of the next major feature update.

Vivetool uses a public ID. In fact, each Vivetool ID corresponds to a real CFR Key.

Controlled Feature Rollout (CFR) List:
