# How to revert All Gradual rollout of features
1. Open Regedit.exe.
2. Delete 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\ControlSet001\Control\FeatureManagement\Overrides\14'.
3. You will now need to restart your computer, for the changes to take effect.
